    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Transfer learning as a recipe: a big labelled set for one question, a handful of labels for a new one. 1) Pretrain a classifier on 1,000 digit images, all ten digits. 2) Build a model for the new question, \"is the digit 5 or more?\", and copy the pretrained backbone into it; only the head is new. 3) Freeze the backbone with FreezeParameters and train the head on just 20 labelled images, two per digit. Below it, the same model trains from scratch on the same 20 images. On the 777 images neither run trained on, the frozen backbone scores 0.932 and the baseline 0.718. Transfer only helps when the pretrained features fit the new task: pretrained on digits 0 to 4 and asked about 5 to 9, it loses to the baseline. Keep the baseline next to every transfer run.\n\n把遷移學習當成標準做法：一個問題有大量標註，新的問題只有幾個標註。1) 用 1,000 張數字影像（十個數字都有）預訓練一個分類器。2) 為新的問題「這個數字是否大於等於 5？」建一個模型，把預訓練的骨幹複製進去，只有分類頭是新的。3) 用 FreezeParameters 凍結骨幹，只用 20 張標註影像（每個數字兩張）訓練分類頭。下方是同一個模型只用這 20 張從頭訓練。在兩邊都沒訓練過的 777 張影像上，凍結骨幹得到 0.932，基準線得到 0.718。只有預訓練學到的特徵適用於新任務時，遷移才有幫助：用數字 0 到 4 預訓練、再問 5 到 9，它就會輸給基準線。所以每次遷移都要把基準線放在旁邊。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-freeze",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 4266,
        "y": -284
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "FreezeParameters picks parameters by name. A SequentialModel names them layers.<layer id>.weight and .bias, so the layer ids set in the architecture editor (backbone1, backbone2, head) are what match refers to: layers.head. with invert on freezes everything except the head. Its report says what is frozen: frozen: 4 tensors, 16,576 parameters; trainable: 2 tensors, 130 parameters. To fine-tune the whole model later, add a second FreezeParameters set to unfreeze with match left empty.\n\nFreezeParameters 依名稱挑參數。SequentialModel 的參數名稱是 layers.<層 id>.weight 與 .bias，所以 match 指的就是在架構編輯器裡設定的層 id（backbone1、backbone2、head）：match 填 layers.head. 並開啟 invert，就會凍結分類頭以外的一切。它的 report 說明凍結了什麼：frozen: 4 tensors, 16,576 parameters; trainable: 2 tensors, 130 parameters。之後要微調整個模型，再加一個 FreezeParameters，設為 unfreeze、match 留空即可。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "freeze",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -596
        },
        "noteWidth": 340
      }
    }
